"The App Store purchase went through, but the account server has not recorded it yet. It will sync automatically." = "App Store 购买已完成，但账户服务器尚未记录。它会自动同步。";
"The App Store receipt could not be verified. Try restoring purchases." = "无法验证 App Store 收据。请尝试恢复购买。";
"The App Store subscription was found, but the account server could not be reached. Try again later." = "已找到 App Store 订阅，但无法连接账户服务器。请稍后再试。";
"The account could not be saved on this phone." = "无法在本机保存账户信息。";
"The account server could not be reached." = "无法连接账户服务器。";
"The account server had a problem. Try again shortly." = "账户服务器出现问题。请稍后再试。";
"The account server is only used for signing in, the subscription and the paid plan. Attachments and conversations stay between this phone and your computer." = "账户服务器仅用于登录、订阅和付费状态。附件和对话只在你的手机和电脑之间传输。";
"The invite code was accepted." = "邀请码已接受。";
"The invite code was accepted. Paid until %@." = "邀请码已接受。付费至 %@。";
"The purchase is waiting for approval. The plan updates once it is approved." = "购买正在等待批准。批准后账户状态会更新。";
"This account has been disabled." = "该账户已被禁用。";
"This account's id could not be read, so the purchase cannot be linked to it." = "无法读取该账户的 ID，因此购买无法关联到账户。";
"This cannot be undone. The account, its devices and its invite records are removed on the server. An App Store subscription is not cancelled by deleting the account; cancel it in your Apple ID subscription settings." = "此操作无法撤销。账户、设备和邀请记录都会从服务器移除。删除账户不会取消 App Store 订阅，请在 Apple ID 的订阅设置中取消。";
"This computer's DSH plugin is too old to receive attachments. Update DSH on the computer, then try again." = "这台电脑上的 DSH 插件版本过旧，无法接收附件。请先在电脑上更新 DSH，然后重试。";
"This device was signed out. Sign in again." = "此设备已退出登录。请重新登录。";
"This subscription is linked to another account." = "该订阅已关联到其他账户。";
"This subscription is not available from the App Store right now." = "该订阅目前无法从 App Store 获取。";
"Those attachments add up to more than %@." = "这些附件合计超过 %@。";
"Those details were not accepted. Check them and try again." = "这些信息未被接受。请检查后重试。";
"Too many attempts. Wait a moment and try again." = "尝试次数过多。请稍等片刻后重试。";
"Username" = "用户名";
"Username or email" = "用户名或邮箱";
"You're subscribed. Thank you for supporting DSH-Mizar." = "订阅成功。感谢你支持 DSH-Mizar。";
"Your sign-in has expired. Sign in again." = "登录已过期。请重新登录。";
"file" = "文件";
"signed in %@" = "登录于 %@";
"That file is empty." = "该文件是空的。";
